    "type": "comment",
    "name": "Stream Dock: something on one key",
    "info": "Press the button on the left of an inject node to try it.\n\nThe pad is the tab's PAD setting (double-click the tab, Environment variables). It's the Stream Dock 293S now; the AKP03E is 1517fe74e923118ab4d66d5726fa21b8.\n\nshow_on_key fields: key (3, \"3\" or \"key_3\"), title, message, icon (mdi:...), color [r,g,b], seconds (default 30, 0 = until pressed), camera (camera.*), picture (image.*, /local/..., an http(s) address or a data: address), fit (fill, fit, stretch).\n\nPressing a key that shows something takes it away and does nothing else.",
